= Ontology =
Ontology is the study or specification of what exists and how entities or categories of entities relate.

In knowledge engineering, an ontology makes classes, properties, relationships, and constraints explicit enough to support shared interpretation and machine reasoning.

== In BITwiki ==
Ontology informs entity types, semantic properties, relationship vocabulary, and the boundaries between concepts. It should not be confused with navigation or category-tree aesthetics.

